@startuml
title SD-03 - Section Transfer
autonumber
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
participant "Admin Staff" as P0
participant "Section UI" as P1
participant "Enrollment Service" as P2
participant "Assignment Repository" as P3
participant "Database" as P4
P0 -> P1 : Select enrollment + target section + date
P1 -> P2 : transferSection(request)
P2 -> P2 : Authorize + validate academic year
P2 -> P3 : beginTransaction + lock enrollment
P3 -> P4 : SELECT FOR UPDATE active assignment
P4 -> P3 : Current assignment
P2 -> P2 : Check date, overlap and section eligibility
P2 -> P3 : closeCurrentAndCreateNew()
P3 -> P4 : UPDATE effectiveTo; INSERT assignment
P4 -> P3 : Commit / rollback
P3 -> P2 : Transfer result
note over P1: alt: success or conflict
P1 -> P0 : Show history / error
@enduml
